{"server":"cn","storyId":"act18d3_level_act18d3_06_beg","groupId":"act18d3","stageId":"act18d3_06","title":"厌食","storyCode":"SV-6","avgTag":"行动前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act18d3/level_act18d3_06_beg.txt","sourceHash":"b886ad810ff4702c836ca781d1f788a2c2f829b3f79af36d99e461af53666ca8","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ibindoor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"没有尽头......浓雾弥漫......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"哼哼~哼......♪"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"歌手，你醒啦！早上好啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谁在唱歌？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"这、这是歌吗？我不会唱。你睡着的时候，嘴里总在哼着这几句哩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"哎哟！歌手你......你抓我抓得太用力啦......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"妈妈......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怪物......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怪物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怪物！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳......歌手，你的箱子......压得我胸口好疼......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"松、松手了？刚才吓死我了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"歌手，我还以为你想杀了我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是可以杀死你。很简单。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"但你不想杀我呀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，我不知道。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"诶？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"又、又来？突然就冲了出去......歌手，你要去哪里啊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ibcoastn"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"......长官，快涨潮了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"海的颜色......那一块颜色变了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"水里有什么东西......是、是贝壳和鳞类？为什么海水里突然有这些？而且还在不断向岸边靠近？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"沿着不该存在的洋流，从更深处来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"什么？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"我还以为......他们去海里，宣称这能换来吃的，只是一种荒诞的迷信。我以为，他们是在绝望之中受人蛊惑，胡言乱语......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"没想到，他们、他们竟然真的与大海交易？他们把自己人当作饵料，喂养大海里的怪物，然后怪物也喂食他们？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"这可怕的畸形的共生关系......难怪，这里的恐鱼会有这么多！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"可是昨天......昨天我以为我阻止了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"不是所有的纠正都有结果，你该学到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"是我错了么，长官？我只是想救他们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"要纠正一处错的，要么使错的走回正道——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"可是......对他们来说，什么是正道？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"盐风城......这片土地和海岸，再也无法孕育任何食物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"结局早在几十年前便已注定，一切挣扎都是徒劳，移动城市、文明和这里的人，都在慢性死亡的路上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"他们问我。如果......如果已经无路可走，如何才能分清对错？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"——又或者使错的不存在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"长官......！您的意思是要我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"你在怀疑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"我......不，我不敢。我只是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然他们......现在变成了这样。他们也曾经是伊比利亚的居民。我想保护他们，我希望我能使这里的人......使这个国家变好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"你该怀疑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"要作出判决，你需靠你自己！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"是，长官......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"看看这片海。你看到了什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"是......威胁！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"不要背诵答案。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"是，长官！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"海水在......流动。在不断地变化。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"记住你看到的一切。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"变化已然、正在、将要发生。如果无法看得更清楚，你将会迷失。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"长官，您脚下是？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"你认为呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"一只恐鱼......是晚上攻击街道的漏网之鱼？！不，好像不是......这一只在海岸上徘徊......它爬了好长的一段路......不大一样......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"是......我，呃，我应该知道......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"是必须净化的邪恶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"......我明白了。我看清了......交易的全貌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"原来，走进海里的人会变成这副样子……这里不仅仅是怪物的巢穴，还是温床。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"这么说的话，这里的所有人都会变成怪物！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"（握紧剑鞘）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判官","speakerId":"avg_npc_182","isRemote":false,"text":"长官，我再回城一趟。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......呼呼......歌、歌手......你跑得太快了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看来还不够快。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"又让你追了上来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"哈......哈哈......歌手，这里可是我家......我对这个地方，可比你熟多啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我该走了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"走？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"离开这里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"咦，你知道去哪里找你的同伴了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......至少，离你们远一点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？为什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那个审判官，她有一件事说得很对。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"她话说挺多的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对你们来说，我很危险。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"因为昨天晚上的事？你救了我们呀，歌手，我们都很感谢你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"救了你们？你是这么觉得的吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果，那些恐鱼，有一只我没有杀掉。它可能就会在行进的路上，将你绞碎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你会被它杀死。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它是我带来的，所以你是被我杀死。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"不，不是这样的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么不是？这样的事，不是没发生过。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们因我而死。他们恨我，怕我，责怪我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"那是......他们不对！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"这又不是歌手故意的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不是故意的吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在那之后......我就不知道了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我以为，杀掉它，我会有答案。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"歌手......你的脸色好差。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"你刚受伤，还消耗了那么多体力，还没有完全恢复吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"你还是跟我回去好好休息，等再睡一觉，你会好些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你为什么不怕我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"咦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你奶奶叫我怪物。你的同伴看我的眼神充满了敌意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"到哪里......都是这种眼神。我早就习惯了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你呢？在你眼里，我是什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"你是......你是歌手呀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"歌手。我说了，你就信。那个审判官就不信。现在我说我是怪物，你信不信？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"......不信。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你到底为什么老跟着我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我能给的东西都可以给你。你却不要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你也不是想杀了我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"杀、杀你？不，歌手，我怎么会有这种想法？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我做事，你给报酬。或者相反。陆上的人都是这样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"交换，就会有约定。有约定，才有信任。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"约定？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不知道什么是约定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"（摇头）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你听好。我说的，你帮了我，我会给你你想要的。这就是约定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"......我什么都不要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说谎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"猎......我的鼻子和眼睛一样灵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你说，这是你家，所以你能很快找到这里来。你也在说谎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不说实话，我就不会信你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"不，歌手，你不要走！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"我没有不说实话。我只是......不明白。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"歌手，你对我们......对我来说是一个谜。你是外面来的人，我从来没见过你这样的人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"你想知道，我为什么猜到你在这里，我不是不说实话，我是......不好意思。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"这里是......边缘。离城区最远。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"我明白你在躲着我们。我想，你要走的话，你大概也会来这里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"我经常偷偷来这里。当然，瞒着铁皮他们。他们发现我总跑这么远，会不高兴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"你看那一块，很高。我有时候会爬上去。因为风更大，我能看得更远。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你好奇外面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"我不知道。我......我有时候会想外面是什么样子的。这很没意义，我懂，他们都这么说，所以我只敢一个人偷偷想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"我出去捡东西的时候，最远也就走到这里。再外面......外面没有什么有用的了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好奇的话，再走远一些就知道了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"以前我去最西边，铁皮会威胁我。他说外面都是怪物，我们一出去就会死掉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"歌手，你是从外面来的。我跟着你，其实我有许许多多问题......我想知道，铁皮他说的是真的吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或许。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"去外面的话，你会死掉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......原来是真的啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你并没有失望。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"歌手，我想，有机会的话，我要去看看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"就算有怪物也没啥......我好像并没有那么怕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"审判官说，我不怕怪物，是因为我不知道怪物会对我做什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"我觉得她说的对。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她胡扯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也不怕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈......那是因为，歌手你知道，在你面前，怪物什么都做不了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"我不一样。昨天夜里，我第一次看清楚了那些怪物。我不知道我会怎样，我的心脏怦怦直跳，跳得从来没有那么——剧烈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"再后来，今天早上我醒过来，我竟然发现这天气从未感受过的美好。我能感到风在流动，看到海浪在靠近。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"这样的一天，和过去的每一天都不一样。就因为我不知道可能会发生什么，而不是一眼从天亮望到天黑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你很亢奋。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"这是亢奋？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"害怕，亢奋。没什么差别。都是心跳加快，血液变热。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"我是病了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这不是病。对有些人来说，这是活着。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"原来活着的感觉这么好。外面的日子，是不是每一天都能这样？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"总比这里强些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"......我真的可以到外面去吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"我的盒子......等我的盒子装满。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"我要......多攒些食物。我要安顿好佩特拉奶奶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"我......哎呦！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这么不小心的话，是会被怪物吃掉的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"歌手......你又救了我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......要是你不跑来的话，就不会这么多事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈......抱、抱歉啦......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"咦？咦咦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"我的腿......好像有什么东西抓着我的腿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"滑、滑滑的......好重！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......又来了。到处都是。烦人的东西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"呜......歌手，我、我快抓不住你了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"闭上眼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"咦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然后松手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"......可以吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要不要信我，你可以选。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
